print("A skill that comes with the lamp, rest-your-eyes, has fired (someone has looked at the screen about three quarters of an hour, and the lamp tilts and softens its light). What the lamp says now: one short, light line suggesting a rest for the eyes, perhaps looking at something far away. Answer with that one line alone, the very words the lamp will say, in the language the owner speaks with the lamp: nothing else, no tool, never making, changing or removing a skill. If nothing fitting comes to mind, answer -.")
